# Implementation Plan - Phase 4: Payments & Finance (Stripe Connect)

# Goal Description
Implement the financial backbone of Spendigo. This includes the "Split Payment" logic using Stripe Connect (destination charges or separate transfers) to ensure stores get paid directly, Spendigo takes its commission, and the consumer sees a clear breakdown.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Stripe Connect Flow**:
> We will use **Direct Charges** (if stores have Standard accounts) or **Destination Charges** (if Express/Custom).
> - **Decision**: **Destination Charges** with `on_behalf_of`. This allows Spendigo to be the platform but NOT the seller of record in the eyes of the customer for support, while the receipt clearer shows the merchant.
> - **Reason**: Better control over the checkout experience (Split payments).

> [!WARNING]
> **Receipt Compliance**:
> Phase 5 (next) covers tax, but we must ensure the *Payment Receipt* generated now includes the "Sold by [Store Name]" lines as per regulation.

